WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.233
Alright,

00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:10.100
a word analogy!

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.600
Bee is to hive,

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.067
as bird is to...

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:15.700
what?

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:16.333
A.

00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:16.967
Nest,

00:00:16.967 --> 00:00:17.567
B.

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:18.200
Tree,

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:18.833
C.

00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:19.433
Egg,

00:00:19.433 --> 00:00:20.700
or D.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:21.300
Sky?

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.567
Five seconds!

00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:29.533
TIME'S UP!

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:30.633
It's...

00:00:30.633 --> 00:00:31.033
A,

00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:31.467
nest!

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:34.000
A bee lives in a hive,

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.567
so a bird lives in a

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:36.967
nest.

00:00:36.967 --> 00:00:39.500
Each one is the home that

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.367
animal builds.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.033
Okay,

00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:43.633
a picture puzzle!

00:00:43.633 --> 00:00:46.800
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:47.333
A.

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:47.867
Top-left,

00:00:47.867 --> 00:00:48.400
B.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:48.900
Bottom-right,

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:49.433
C.

00:00:49.433 --> 00:00:49.967
Center,

00:00:49.967 --> 00:00:51.033
or D.

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:51.567
Bottom-left?

00:00:51.567 --> 00:00:52.633
Five seconds!

00:00:58.400 --> 00:00:59.600
TIME'S UP!

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:01.800
The answer is...

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:02.300
B,

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:02.800
bottom-right!

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:05.333
The dot steps clockwise corner

00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:06.333
to corner:

00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:06.867
bottom-left,

00:01:06.867 --> 00:01:07.367
top-left,

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:07.867
top-right,

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:10.900
so the next corner is bottom-right.

00:01:12.067 --> 00:01:12.700
Alright,

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:14.533
a number analogy!

00:01:14.533 --> 00:01:16.400
Two makes three,

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:18.233
three makes five,

00:01:18.233 --> 00:01:20.100
four makes seven,

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.933
so five makes...

00:01:21.933 --> 00:01:22.567
what?

00:01:22.567 --> 00:01:23.167
A.

00:01:23.167 --> 00:01:23.800
Eight,

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:24.400
B.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:25.033
Ten,

00:01:25.033 --> 00:01:25.633
C.

00:01:25.633 --> 00:01:26.267
Eleven,

00:01:26.267 --> 00:01:27.500
or D.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:28.100
Nine?

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.333
Five seconds!

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:36.333
TIME'S UP!

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:37.500
It's...

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:38.033
D,

00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:38.533
nine!

00:01:38.533 --> 00:01:41.600
Each number is doubled then take

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:42.633
away one:

00:01:42.633 --> 00:01:45.200
five times two is ten,

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.233
minus one is nine.

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:48.800
So,

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.833
are you smart or fart?

00:01:50.833 --> 00:01:53.267
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:53.267 --> 00:01:54.467
find your rank!

00:01:55.633 --> 00:01:55.967
So,

00:01:55.967 --> 00:01:57.367
how did you do?

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:58.733
Comment your score below,

00:01:58.733 --> 00:02:00.100
and follow for more!
